            <title>2.15.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 19:33:59 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>89</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.15.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- The sidebar's pane highlight no longer swallows the activity dot. The accent-tinted fill behind a paned row competed with the dot's own colour and washed out the low-saturation states — idle grey most of all. The fill is now neutral and identical for focused and unfocused panes; the focused pane is marked by a thin outline instead, so the dot is the only thing in the sidebar whose hue carries meaning.
]]></description>
