        <item>
            <title>2.15.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 14:28:41 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>88</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.15.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features

- **Save and Quit** — quitting with sessions open now offers to save the layout. The next launch rebuilds the detail column as it was: the same panes in the same left-to-right order, at the same widths, with the same pane focused, and each session resumed with its own working directory, permission mode, model, effort level and provider. The quit prompt reads `Save and Quit` / `Quit` / `Cancel`, or `Save and Restart` / `Restart` / `Cancel` when an extension update triggered the restart.

### Bug Fixes

- Fixed a pane occasionally rendering as a blank white rectangle even though its session was healthy — two AppKit views could end up fighting over the same web view, and the one left on screen could be the empty one.
- Fixed a pane occasionally showing an empty conversation instead of its history when several panes opened at the same moment.
]]></description>
